{'symbol': 'STE', 'date': '2021-06-02 09:00:00', 'title': 'STERIS COMPLETES THE ACQUISITION OF CANTEL MEDICAL', 'text': 'DUBLIN, IRELAND, JUNE 02, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \xa0STERIS PLC (NYSE: STE) (“STERIS” OR THE “COMPANY”) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED ACQUISITION OF CANTEL MEDICAL, A GLOBAL PROVIDER OF INFECTION PREVENTION PRODUCTS AND SERVICES TO ENDOSCOPY, DENTAL, DIALYSIS AND LIFE SCIENCES CUSTOMERS.'}